# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/WoodenSpoon.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen:       Wooden Spoon Passage
# This was the passage raffled at the Morgannwg vs. Isca skittles match.
# The raffle was won by Sue Mabbett, secretary of SWCC, who rather
# ungratefully named it "Wooden Spoon".
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Saturday 19th November by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# Recording: ?
# Tape: ?
# Compass: ?
# Data entry: Tim Long

survey woodenspoon

